source: crates/navree-orm/tests/render/lowering.rs
expression: "query(Company::query().join_lateral(Deal::query().select([Deal::TITLE.expr()]).where_column(Deal::COMPANY_ID,\n\"=\", Company::ID).order_by_desc(Deal::CREATED_AT).limit(2),\n\"latest\").add_select([\"latest.title\"]))"
---
PostgreSQL: SELECT "companies"."id", "companies"."name", "companies"."country", "latest"."title" FROM "companies" INNER JOIN LATERAL (SELECT "deals"."title" FROM "deals" WHERE "deals"."company_id" = "companies"."id" AND "deals"."deleted_at" IS NULL ORDER BY "deals"."created_at" DESC LIMIT $1) AS "latest" ON TRUE
  values: [U64(2)]
MySQL: SELECT `companies`.`id`, `companies`.`name`, `companies`.`country`, `latest`.`title` FROM `companies` INNER JOIN LATERAL (SELECT `deals`.`title` FROM `deals` WHERE `deals`.`company_id` = `companies`.`id` AND `deals`.`deleted_at` IS NULL ORDER BY `deals`.`created_at` DESC LIMIT ?) AS `latest` ON TRUE
  values: [U64(2)]
SQLite: error: a lateral join is not supported on SQLite
